<section aria-labelledby="demo-h">
  <h2 id="demo-h" class="type-h2">Link card</h2>
  <p>A card that links to one page. The whole card is the link. The button at the bottom is a visual cue: it is not a second control, so the card has one tab stop. The button is filled like the primary button.</p>
  {% demo "A link card with placeholder text" %}
  <a class="link-card" href="#" aria-labelledby="demo-card-title"><h3 class="link-card__title type-h3" id="demo-card-title">Card title</h3><p class="link-card__text type-body">One short line about the page.</p><span class="button type-button button--primary link-card__button" aria-hidden="true"><span class="button__label">View the page</span></span></a>
  {% enddemo %}
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="states-h">
  <h2 id="states-h" class="type-h2">States</h2>
  <p>Hover, press and tab to the card above to see each state.</p>
  <div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Link card states, scrollable">
